# Copter: AUTO_OPTIONS 3 allows arming in AUTO + take off in AUTO without
# throttle -> the supervisor's "start" (goto seq 1 + AUTO) lifts off by itself.
# DISARM_DELAY 127 (the parameter's maximum - it is an int8) gives the
# operator + op START time between "arm" and takeoff: the fleet START runs
# an FC-mission readback that takes a while on large packages, and every
# armed unit must still be armed when its turn comes.
AUTO_OPTIONS    3
DISARM_DELAY    127
